  "notebook": {
    "id": "default",
    "name": "Analisis Graf Panggilan dan Deteksi Komponen Terhubung Kuat (SCC)",
    "autoNameNumber": null,
    "description": "",
    "kernelLanguage": "prolog",
    "catalogId": null,
    "catalogRevision": null,
    "cellCounter": 38,
    "cells": [
      {
        "id": 1,
        "code": "# Analisis Graf Panggilan dan Deteksi Komponen Terhubung Kuat (SCC)\n\nBuku catatan ini mengeksplorasi kemampuan analisis kode tingkat lanjut dari UnifyWeaver:\n\n- **Konstruksi Graf Panggilan** — Membangun graf ketergantungan dari kode Prolog\n- **Deteksi SCC** — Menemukan komponen terhubung kuat (rekursi timbal balik)\n- **Analisis Pola** — Memahami pola rekursi\n- **Visualisasi Ketergantungan** — Representasi visual hubungan predikat\n\n## Tujuan Pembelajaran\n\n- Memahami bagaimana UnifyWeaver menganalisis struktur kode\n- Membangun dan memeriksa graf panggilan\n- Mendeteksi rekursi timbal balik menggunakan algoritma Tarjan\n- Memvisualisasikan ketergantungan kode",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 2,
        "code": "## Pengaturan\n\nMemuat UnifyWeaver dan modul analisis.",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 3,
        "code": "% Muat inisialisasi\n['../init'].\n\n% Muat modul analisis\nuse_module(unifyweaver(core/advanced/call_graph)).\nuse_module(unifyweaver(core/advanced/scc_detection)).\nuse_module(unifyweaver(core/advanced/pattern_matchers)).",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "prolog",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "Cannot find file: ../init",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"error-result\" dir=\"ltr\">Cannot find file: ../init</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 4,
        "code": "## Contoh 1: Graf Panggilan Sederhana\n\nMari kita mulai dengan predikat sederhana dan buat graf panggilannya.",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 5,
        "code": "% Definisikan predikat ancestor\n:- dynamic ancestor/2.\n:- dynamic parent/2.\n\n% Fakta parent\nparent(abraham, isaac).\nparent(isaac, jacob).\n\n% Aturan ancestor\nancestor(X, Y) :- parent(X, Y).\nancestor(X, Z) :- parent(X, Y), ancestor(Y, Z).",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "prolog",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "true.",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"text-result\" dir=\"ltr\">true.</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 6,
        "code": "### Membangun Graf Panggilan",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 7,
        "code": "% Bangun graf panggilan untuk ancestor\nbuild_call_graph([ancestor/2], _Graph),\nformat('Call Graph for ancestor/2:~n'),\nforall(member(_Edge, _Graph),\n    format('  ~w~n', [_Edge])).",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "prolog",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "'<meta-call>'/1: Unknown procedure: build_call_graph/2",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"error-result\" dir=\"ltr\">'&lt;meta-call&gt;'/1: Unknown procedure: build_call_graph/2</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 8,
        "code": "### Menganalisis Ketergantungan",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 9,
        "code": "% Dapatkan semua dependensi dari ancestor/2\nget_dependencies(ancestor/2, _Deps),\nformat('Dependencies of ancestor/2: ~w~n', [_Deps]).\n\n% Periksa apakah rekursif mandiri\n(is_self_recursive(ancestor/2) ->\n    writeln('✓ ancestor/2 is self-recursive')\n;\n    writeln('✗ ancestor/2 is not self-recursive')\n).",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "prolog",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "'<meta-call>'/1: Unknown procedure: get_dependencies/2",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"error-result\" dir=\"ltr\">'&lt;meta-call&gt;'/1: Unknown procedure: get_dependencies/2</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 10,
        "code": "## Contoh 2: Deteksi Rekursi Timbal Balik\n\nSekarang mari kita deteksi rekursi timbal balik dengan contoh genap/ganjil.",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 11,
        "code": "% Definisikan predikat yang saling rekursif\n:- dynamic is_even/1.\n:- dynamic is_odd/1.\n\nis_even(0).\nis_even(N) :- N > 0, N1 is N - 1, is_odd(N1).\n\nis_odd(1).\nis_odd(N) :- N > 1, N1 is N - 1, is_even(N1).",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "prolog",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "true.",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"text-result\" dir=\"ltr\">true.</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 12,
        "code": "### Membangun Graf Panggilan untuk Kedua Predikat",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 13,
        "code": "% Bangun graf panggilan untuk kedua predikat\nbuild_call_graph([is_even/1, is_odd/1], _Graph),\nformat('Call Graph for is_even/1 and is_odd/1:~n'),\nforall(member(_Edge, _Graph),\n    format('  ~w~n', [_Edge])).",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "prolog",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "'<meta-call>'/1: Unknown procedure: build_call_graph/2",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"error-result\" dir=\"ltr\">'&lt;meta-call&gt;'/1: Unknown procedure: build_call_graph/2</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 14,
        "code": "### Menemukan Komponen Terhubung Kuat (SCC)",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 15,
        "code": "% Bangun kembali graf karena variabel tidak bertahan di antara sel buku catatan\nbuild_call_graph([is_even/1, is_odd/1], _Graph),\n% Temukan SCC menggunakan algoritma Tarjan\nfind_sccs(_Graph, _SCCs),\nformat('Strongly Connected Components:~n'),\nforall(member(_SCC, _SCCs),\n    format('  ~w~n', [_SCC])).",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "prolog",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "'<meta-call>'/1: Unknown procedure: build_call_graph/2",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"error-result\" dir=\"ltr\">'&lt;meta-call&gt;'/1: Unknown procedure: build_call_graph/2</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 16,
        "code": "### Memeriksa apakah SCC Trivial",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 17,
        "code": "% Hitung ulang nilai turunan agar sel ini juga berjalan secara independen\nbuild_call_graph([is_even/1, is_odd/1], _Graph),\nfind_sccs(_Graph, _SCCs),\n% Periksa setiap SCC\nforall(member(_SCC, _SCCs),\n    (   is_trivial_scc(_SCC) ->\n        format('  ~w is trivial (single predicate)~n', [_SCC])\n    ;\n        format('  ~w is NON-TRIVIAL (mutual recursion!)~n', [_SCC])\n    )\n).",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "prolog",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "'<meta-call>'/1: Unknown procedure: build_call_graph/2",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"error-result\" dir=\"ltr\">'&lt;meta-call&gt;'/1: Unknown procedure: build_call_graph/2</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 18,
        "code": "## Contoh 3: Graf Panggilan Kompleks\n\nMari kita analisis sistem yang lebih kompleks dengan banyak predikat.",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 19,
        "code": "% Definisikan program kecil dengan banyak predikat\n:- dynamic grandparent/2.\n:- dynamic sibling/2.\n:- dynamic cousin/2.\n\n% grandparent menggunakan parent\ngrandparent(X, Z) :- parent(X, Y), parent(Y, Z).\n\n% sibling: orang tua sama, anak berbeda\nsibling(X, Y) :- parent(P, X), parent(P, Y), X \\= Y.\n\n% cousin: orang tua adalah saudara kandung\ncousin(X, Y) :- parent(P1, X), parent(P2, Y), sibling(P1, P2).",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "prolog",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "true.",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"text-result\" dir=\"ltr\">true.</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 20,
        "code": "### Membangun Graf Panggilan Lengkap",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 21,
        "code": "% Bangun graf panggilan untuk semua predikat\nbuild_call_graph([grandparent/2, sibling/2, cousin/2], _Graph),\nformat('Complete Call Graph:~n'),\nforall(member(_Edge, _Graph),\n    format('  ~w~n', [_Edge])).",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "prolog",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "'<meta-call>'/1: Unknown procedure: build_call_graph/2",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"error-result\" dir=\"ltr\">'&lt;meta-call&gt;'/1: Unknown procedure: build_call_graph/2</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 22,
        "code": "### Menemukan Kelompok Predikat\n\nMenemukan kelompok predikat yang saling rekursif yang berisi predikat awal.",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 23,
        "code": "% Temukan kelompok rekursi timbal balik yang berisi cousin/2\npredicates_in_group(cousin/2, _Group),\nformat('Mutually recursive group containing cousin/2: ~w~n', [_Group]).",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "prolog",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "'<meta-call>'/1: Unknown procedure: predicates_in_group/2",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"error-result\" dir=\"ltr\">'&lt;meta-call&gt;'/1: Unknown procedure: predicates_in_group/2</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 24,
        "code": "## Contoh 4: Deteksi Pola\n\nGunakan pencocok pola untuk menganalisis tipe rekursi.",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 25,
        "code": "% Definisikan berbagai pola rekursi\n:- dynamic count/3.     % Rekursif ekor\n:- dynamic factorial/2. % Rekursif linier\n:- dynamic fib/2.       % Rekursif pohon (atau linier jika terdeteksi)\n\n% Hitungan rekursi ekor\ncount([], Acc, Acc).\ncount([_|T], Acc, N) :-\n    Acc1 is Acc + 1,\n    count(T, Acc1, N).\n\n% Faktorial rekursi linier\nfactorial(0, 1).\nfactorial(N, F) :-\n    N > 0,\n    N1 is N - 1,\n    factorial(N1, F1),\n    F is N * F1.\n\n% Fibonacci (dapat dideteksi sebagai linier atau pohon)\nfib(0, 0).\nfib(1, 1).\nfib(N, F) :-\n    N > 1,\n    N1 is N - 1,\n    N2 is N - 2,\n    fib(N1, F1),\n    fib(N2, F2),\n    F is F1 + F2.",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "prolog",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "true.",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"text-result\" dir=\"ltr\">true.</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 26,
        "code": "### Mendeteksi Rekursi Ekor",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 27,
        "code": "% Periksa apakah count/3 adalah rekursif ekor\n(is_tail_recursive_accumulator(count/3, _AccInfo) ->\n    format('✓ count/3 is tail recursive: ~w~n', [_AccInfo])\n;\n    writeln('✗ count/3 is not tail recursive')\n).",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "prolog",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "'<meta-call>'/1: Unknown procedure: is_tail_recursive_accumulator/2",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"error-result\" dir=\"ltr\">'&lt;meta-call&gt;'/1: Unknown procedure: is_tail_recursive_accumulator/2</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 28,
        "code": "### Mendeteksi Rekursi Linier",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 29,
        "code": "% Periksa apakah factorial/2 adalah rekursif linier\n(is_linear_recursive_streamable(factorial/2) ->\n    writeln('✓ factorial/2 is linear recursive')\n;\n    writeln('✗ factorial/2 is not linear recursive')\n).",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "prolog",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "'<meta-call>'/1: Unknown procedure: is_linear_recursive_streamable/1",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"error-result\" dir=\"ltr\">'&lt;meta-call&gt;'/1: Unknown procedure: is_linear_recursive_streamable/1</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 30,
        "code": "### Menghitung Panggilan Rekursif",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 31,
        "code": "% Hitung panggilan rekursif dalam fibonacci\nfunctor(_FibHead, fib, 2),\nuser:clause(_FibHead, _FibBody),\nonce(contains_call_to(_FibBody, fib)),\ncount_recursive_calls(_FibBody, fib, _Count),\nformat('Fibonacci body has ~w recursive calls~n', [_Count]).",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "prolog",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "once/1: Unknown procedure: contains_call_to/2",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"error-result\" dir=\"ltr\">once/1: Unknown procedure: contains_call_to/2</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 32,
        "code": "## Visualisasi dengan Format DOT\n\nMari kita hasilkan representasi Graphviz DOT dari graf panggilan kita.",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 33,
        "code": "% Fungsi pembantu untuk menghasilkan format DOT\ngenerate_dot(Graph, DotCode) :-\n    findall(Line,\n        (   member(From -> To, Graph),\n            format(atom(Line), '  \"~w\" -> \"~w\";', [From, To])\n        ),\n        Lines),\n    atomic_list_concat(['digraph CallGraph {', '  rankdir=LR;' | Lines], '\\n', Body),\n    format(atom(DotCode), '~w~n}~n', [Body]).\n\n% Hasilkan DOT untuk graf genap/ganjil\nbuild_call_graph([is_even/1, is_odd/1], _Graph),\ngenerate_dot(_Graph, _DotCode),\nwriteln('DOT Code for even/odd call graph:'),\nwriteln(_DotCode).",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "prolog",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "'<meta-call>'/1: Unknown procedure: build_call_graph/2",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"error-result\" dir=\"ltr\">'&lt;meta-call&gt;'/1: Unknown procedure: build_call_graph/2</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 34,
        "code": "### Menyimpan File DOT",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 35,
        "code": "% Bangun kembali sumber DOT karena variabel tidak bertahan di antara sel\nbuild_call_graph([is_even/1, is_odd/1], _Graph),\ngenerate_dot(_Graph, _DotCode),\nsetup_call_cleanup(\n    open('/shared/data/even_odd_graph.dot', write, _Stream),\n    write(_Stream, _DotCode),\n    close(_Stream)),\nwriteln('✓ Saved to /shared/data/even_odd_graph.dot').\n\nwriteln('To visualize, run:'),\nwriteln('  dot -Tpng /shared/data/even_odd_graph.dot -o even_odd_graph.png').",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "prolog",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "'<meta-call>'/1: Unknown procedure: build_call_graph/2",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"error-result\" dir=\"ltr\">'&lt;meta-call&gt;'/1: Unknown procedure: build_call_graph/2</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 36,
        "code": "## Latihan: Analisis Kode Anda Sendiri\n\nCobalah mendefinisikan predikat Anda sendiri dan menganalisisnya!",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 37,
        "code": "% Definisikan predikat Anda di sini\n% Kemudian bangun graf panggilan, temukan SCC, dan deteksi pola\n\n% Contoh:\n% :- dynamic my_predicate/2.\n% my_predicate(...) :- ...\n\n% build_call_graph([my_predicate/2], Graph).\n",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "prolog",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 38,
        "code": "## Ringkasan\n\nDalam buku catatan ini, Anda telah mempelajari:\n\n✅ Cara membangun graf panggilan dari kode Prolog\n\n✅ Cara mendeteksi komponen terhubung kuat (SCC) untuk rekursi timbal balik\n\n✅ Cara menggunakan pencocok pola untuk mengklasifikasikan tipe rekursi\n\n✅ Cara menganalisis ketergantungan predikat\n\n✅ Cara memvisualisasikan graf panggilan dengan format DOT\n\n## Topik Lanjutan\n\nUntuk analisis lebih mendalam:\n\n- **Pengurutan Topologis**: Gunakan `topological_order/2` untuk mengurutkan SCC berdasarkan ketergantungan\n- **Pencocok Pola Kustom**: Tulis predikat deteksi pola Anda sendiri\n- **Ekstraksi Pola Akumulator**: Gunakan `extract_accumulator_pattern/2` untuk analisis terperinci\n- **Larang Rekursi Linier**: Gunakan `forbid_linear_recursion/1` untuk memaksa strategi kompilasi yang berbeda\n\n## Referensi dan File Terkait\n\n- Bab 10: Introspeksi dan Teori Prolog\n- `src/unifyweaver/core/advanced/call_graph.pl`\n- `src/unifyweaver/core/advanced/scc_detection.pl`\n- `src/unifyweaver/core/advanced/pattern_matchers.pl`",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      }
    ]
  }
}